# Agent worktree settings (per-machine, not project content) — but keep
# the project-scoped skill bundle, which ships with the repo. Note: parent
# dir cannot be excluded with `.claude/` if we want to re-include
# `.claude/skills/`; use `.claude/*` instead.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/skills/**

# Overnight automation logs
scripts/overnight_log.txt

# Local-only working notes and scratch (kept on disk, not part of the public repo)
/compute_envelope.py
/docs/CLAUDE_PROJECT_CONTEXT.md
/docs/briefs/
/docs/research_notes/2026-05-03_overnight.md
/docs/research_notes/2026-05-21_jon_meeting_brief.md
